  He said "hello" to (them) now
cursor: 1,11
ext: surround
keys: cs"'
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  He said 'hello' to (them) now
expect-cursor: 1,9
expect-mode: normal

=== cs changes parentheses to brackets
text:
  He said "hello" to (them) now
cursor: 1,22
ext: surround
keys: cs(]
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  He said "hello" to [them] now
expect-cursor: 1,20
expect-mode: normal

=== cs to an opening bracket adds spaces
text:
  He said "hello" to (them) now
cursor: 1,22
ext: surround
keys: cs)[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  He said "hello" to [ them ] now
expect-cursor: 1,20
expect-mode: normal

