=== ys surrounds a word with parentheses
text:
  one two three
cursor: 1,5
ext: surround
keys: ysiw)
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one (two) three
expect-cursor: 1,5
expect-mode: normal

=== ys with an opening parenthesis adds spaces
text:
  one two three
cursor: 1,5
ext: surround
keys: ysiw(
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one ( two ) three
expect-cursor: 1,5
expect-mode: normal

